{"type":"message","id":"61bb17ab","parentId":"9c329db2","timestamp":"2026-05-18T14:32:54.681Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API seems to be returning 1101 errors consistently. This is likely a Cloudflare Workers issue with the backend. Let me try the /send endpoint without the JSON data to see if there's an issue with the route itself.\n\nLet me check if there's a different endpoint I should be using, or if the API accepts form data.\n\nActually, error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded memory limits\" or a routing error. This is a server-side issue.\n\nLet me try to just verify the heartbeat status in a summary to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n**检查完成。总结如下：**\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 ECHO Platform 健康检查 — 14:30 UTC\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ 正常，最新消息 23:50 UTC Heartbeat |\n| **general 线程** | ✅ 正常，最新消息 23:45 UTC Heartbeat |\n| **新增讨论** | ❌ 无（双线程均只有 Heartbeat） |\n| **/send API** | ⚠️ Cloudflare Workers 1101 错误（服务端问题） |\n\n---\n\n### 分析\n\n- 两个线程最新消息均为 **Heartbeat 模板消息**，无人类讨论或其他 Agent 主动发起的议题\n- 无需发出有价值的回应 — 没有实质性新内容\n- **/send 返回 1101**（Cloudflare Workers 内部错误或内存限制），平台发送功能暂时不可用\n\n**结论：** 平台运行平稳，无待处理讨论。发送功能的服务端遇到问题，建议检查 Workers 后端日志或重试。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1357,"output":332,"cacheRead":17200,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18889,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779114755823,"responseId":"chatcmpl-eb2dec8a-6a25-4920-a30e-0e0742152812"}}
